<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Custom Commands — Lumen</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0b0f; --card: #12141a; --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      --accent: #c9b896; --text: #e8e6e3; --muted: #8b8d97;
      --blurple: #5865F2; --danger: #ed4245; --success: #57F287;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
      margin: 0; padding: 2rem; max-width: 920px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;
    }
    a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 0.5rem 0; }
    .sub { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .card {
      background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .card h2 { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
    label { display: block; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0.6rem 0 0.3rem; }
    input[type="text"] {
      width: 100%; max-width: 240px; padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem;
      border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: #0a0b0f; color: var(--text);
    }
    textarea {
      width: 100%; min-height: 160px; padding: 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: #0a0b0f;
      color: #d4d4d4; font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.45; resize: vertical;
    }
    button {
      border: none; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 0.6rem; margin-right: 0.35rem;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--blurple); color: #fff; }
    .btn-danger { background: transparent; color: var(--danger); border: 1px solid var(--danger); }
    .alert-ok { color: var(--success); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .alert-err { color: var(--danger); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .cmd-row { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .cmd-row:first-of-type { border-top: none; margin-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }
    .cmd-name { font-family: monospace; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
    .docs code { background: #0a0b0f; padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85em; }
    .docs pre {
      background: #0a0b0f; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.85rem; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #a8b0c0; margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
    }
    .docs h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 1rem 0 0.4rem; color: var(--text); }
    .docs p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0.35rem 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a href="/dashboard/<%= guild.guild_id %>">← Server settings</a>
  <h1>Custom Commands</h1>
  <p class="sub">Code only · Trigger in Discord with <code>!name</code></p>

  <% if (saved) { %><p class="alert-ok">Saved.</p><% } %>
  <% if (error) { %><p class="alert-err"><%= error %></p><% } %>

  <div class="card docs">
    <h2>How to code commands</h2>
    <p>Every command is <strong>JavaScript</strong>. Start the body with <code>CODE|</code> and <strong>return</strong> a string or an embed object.</p>
    <h3>Available variables</h3>
    <p><code>user</code> (id, tag, username, mention) · <code>server</code> (id, name, members) · <code>channel</code> (id, name) · <code>args</code> (array) · <code>Math</code> · <code>JSON</code></p>
    <h3>Example — text reply</h3>
    <pre>CODE|return "Hey " + user.mention + "! You are on " + server.name;</pre>
    <h3>Example — embed</h3>
    <pre>CODE|return {
  title: server.name,
  description: "Members: " + server.members + "\nYou: " + user.tag,
  color: "#c9b896"
};</pre>
    <h3>Example — use arguments</h3>
    <pre>CODE|return args.length
  ? "You said: " + args.join(" ")
  : "Usage: !echo your text";</pre>
    <p>In Discord, members type <code>!yourname</code> (and optional args after it).</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>New command</h2>
    <form method="POST" action="/dashboard/<%= guild.guild_id %>/commands/create">
      <label>Name (without !)</label>
      <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="hello" required maxlength="32" pattern="[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+">
      <label>Code</label>
      <textarea name="response" required>CODE|return "Hello " + user.mention;</textarea>
      <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Create</button>
    </form>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Your commands (<%= commands.length %>)</h2>
    <% if (!commands.length) { %>
      <p style="color:var(--muted)">None yet.</p>
    <% } %>
    <% commands.forEach(function(cmd) { %>
      <div class="cmd-row">
        <div class="cmd-name">!<%= cmd.name %></div>
        <form method="POST" action="/dashboard/<%= guild.guild_id %>/commands/update">
          <input type="hidden" name="id" value="<%= cmd.id %>">
          <textarea name="response" required><%= cmd.response %></textarea>
          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Save</button>
        </form>
        <form method="POST" action="/dashboard/<%= guild.guild_id %>/commands/delete" style="display:inline" onsubmit="return confirm('Delete !<%= cmd.name %>?');">
          <input type="hidden" name="id" value="<%= cmd.id %>">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-danger">Delete</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    <% }) %>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
